    <dct:title xml:lang="en">General Health Statistic</dct:title>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">General Health Statistic</skos:prefLabel>
    <dct:description xml:lang="en">Numbers about some aspects of health related to a population or an area. For the purpose of this data model, 'general health' data include issues such as self-perceived health, demographic distribution of various health problems, smokers, etc., expressed as raw numbers, rates, percentage, stratified by gender, age, and/or socio-economic, cultural, ethnic or other factors.</dct:description>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Numbers about some aspects of health related to a population or an area. For the purpose of this data model, 'general health' data include issues such as self-perceived health, demographic distribution of various health problems, smokers, etc., expressed as raw numbers, rates, percentage, stratified by gender, age, and/or socio-economic, cultural, ethnic or other factors.</skos:definition>
