    <dct:title xml:lang="en">technical unit</dct:title>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">technical unit</skos:prefLabel>
    <dct:description xml:lang="en">Represents the common "abstract level" for production infrastructures: facilities, installations, installation parts.</dct:description>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Represents the common "abstract level" for production infrastructures: facilities, installations, installation parts.</skos:definition>
    <vann:usageNote xml:lang="en">It applies since the production infrastructures (facility, installation, installation part) may have an UML "equivalent behaviour": this means they have properties in common and the same associations to be reused.</vann:usageNote>
