    <dct:title xml:lang="en">Coastline</dct:title>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Coastline</skos:prefLabel>
    <dct:description xml:lang="en">A special case of a shoreline defined as the shoreline at Mean High Water (MHW). Where there is not significant variation in water level, Mean Sea Level (MSL) can be used as a substitute for MHW.</dct:description>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A special case of a shoreline defined as the shoreline at Mean High Water (MHW). Where there is not significant variation in water level, Mean Sea Level (MSL) can be used as a substitute for MHW.</skos:definition>
