    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Standard Instrument Departure</skos:prefLabel>
    <dct:description xml:lang="en">A designated instrument flight rule (IFR) departure route linking the aerodrome or a specific runway of the aerodrome with a specified significant point, normally on a designated ATS route, at which the en-route phase of a flight commences.</dct:description>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A designated instrument flight rule (IFR) departure route linking the aerodrome or a specific runway of the aerodrome with a specified significant point, normally on a designated ATS route, at which the en-route phase of a flight commences.</skos:definition>
