    <dct:title xml:lang="en">Waterway</dct:title>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Waterway</skos:prefLabel>
    <dct:description xml:lang="en">A collection of water link sequences and or individual waterway and/or watercourse links (as necessary) that are characterized by one or more thematical identifiers and/or properties, which perform a navigable route within a water body (oceans, seas, rivers, lakes, channels or canals).</dct:description>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A collection of water link sequences and or individual waterway and/or watercourse links (as necessary) that are characterized by one or more thematical identifiers and/or properties, which perform a navigable route within a water body (oceans, seas, rivers, lakes, channels or canals).</skos:definition>
