    <dct:title xml:lang="en">Utility Link Sequence</dct:title>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Utility Link Sequence</skos:prefLabel>
    <dct:description xml:lang="en">A linear spatial object, composed of an ordered collection of utility links, which represents a continuous path in the utility network without any branches. The element has a defined beginning and end and every position on the utility link sequence is identifiable with one single parameter.</dct:description>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A linear spatial object, composed of an ordered collection of utility links, which represents a continuous path in the utility network without any branches. The element has a defined beginning and end and every position on the utility link sequence is identifiable with one single parameter.</skos:definition>
