    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The aggregation unit over which the species is distributed.</skos:definition>
    <vann:usageNote xml:lang="en">This model only includes ProtectedSite as an aggregation unit, but others may be added in the future (for example, administrative units and grid units). Candidate type that might be extended in Annex II/III INSPIRE data specification.</vann:usageNote>
